{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 0, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "As he slowly opened his eyes, the bright sunlight streaming through the window was blinding. But it wasn't the sunlight that caught his attention - it was the UI overlay hovering in the corner of his vision. At first, he thought it was just a weird side effect of last night's gaming session, but as he sat up and looked around, he realized that everything was off. The furniture, the decorations, even the clothes he was wearing - they all looked like they belonged in a fantasy RPG. And then there were the notifications: \"Health: 100%\", \"Mana: 50%\", \"Experience: 234/1000\". It was then that the unthinkable hit him: he was inside a video game.\n\n*** \nPanic set in as he scrambled out of bed and staggered to the bathroom. The mirror reflected back a character model with a ridiculously chiseled jawline and an even more ridiculous haircut. He was a non-player character, or NPC, brought to life. The more he explored his surroundings, the more he realized that everything was scripted. The trees outside were perfectly uniform, the birds sang in a loop, and the people on the street followed predetermined paths. He felt like a puppet on strings, controlled by some invisible force. The thought sent a shiver down his spine. How did he end up here? And more importantly, how could he escape?", "logprobs": [{"token": "As", "logprob": -0.07951892912387848}, {"token": " he", "logprob": -0.0349021777510643}, {"token": " slowly", "logprob": -0.03155532851815224}, {"token": " opened", "logprob": -0.00019762947340495884}, {"token": " his", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " eyes", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00026127262390218675}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.28867143392562866}, {"token": " bright", "logprob": -0.04731424152851105}, {"token": " sunlight", "logprob": -0.2341310977935791}, {"token": " streaming", "logprob": -0.0069259805604815